              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninche aadumunye te Kadesh nepuo aaun ilng'oborri to ldoinyo le Hor, to lkirene le nkop e Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
